        "rating": 3,
        "relative_time_description": "7 years ago",
        "text": "The wife and I go here for small incidentals but not too frequently. On the occasions we do go, we generally find what we need. The aisles are very small and the place could be a little more clean. The prices, however, are on par with other déps in the area. The staff is always cheerful and nice to us. The hours are great since they are open after the local stores close. The parking lot is quite small, but nothing they can really do about that. Only a warning, you might have to occasionally wait for a parking spot as they are on s corner an no street parking is available directly outside the establishment.",
